<body><h2>Pocket Pals 1.0.1</h2><p>Pets stay on one Space</p><h3>Changed</h3><ul><li>Pets now live on one Space (desktop) and stay there when you switch to other Spaces. Choose **Move Pets to This Space** from the menu bar to bring them along, or turn on **Follow me to every Space** in Settings › Pets.</li><li>Pets pause while you&#x27;re on another Space, so they use no energy there.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
